	(text "RAIL        V     I TYP    I MAX    BLOCK  LDO         FB TOP/BOT  PDN    LOADS\n----------  ----  -------  -------  -----  ----------  ----------  -----  ---------------------------------\nPLL1        +3.3  165 mA   195 mA   A      TPS7A87     33k2/10k7   D4     ADF4351 #1 (125 MHz clock)\nPLL2        +3.3  150 mA   170 mA   A      TPS7A87     33k2/10k7   D4     ADF4351 #2 (cal / vernier)\nCLK         +3.3  215 mA   300 mA   B1     TPS7A87     33k2/10k7   D4     LMK00304 + fire FF (EP52)\nDELAY       +3.3  230 mA   275 mA   B2     TPS7A87     33k2/10k7   D4     MC100EP195 + strobe FF (EP52)\nVCCO_TRIG   +3.3  44 mA    55 mA    C      TPS7A87     33k2/10k7   C      ADCMP582 #3 trigger VCCO\nREF         +3.3  80 mA*   120 mA*  C      TPS7A87     33k2/10k7   C      Si53360, REF IN/OUT buffers, TCXO\n+5V_CMP     +5.0  23 mA    32 mA    D      TPS7A87     56k2/10k7   RC x4  ADCMP582 x3 VCCI, LT1678 V+\n+5V_DAC     +5.0  3 mA*    5 mA*    D      TPS7A87     56k2/10k7   RC x2  LTC2642 VDD, REF5030 VIN\nVCCO_SMP    +3.3  44 mA    55 mA    E      TPS7A87     33k2/10k7   C      ADCMP582 #1 sampler VCCO\nVCCO_STEP   +3.3  44 mA    55 mA    E      TPS7A87     33k2/10k7   C      ADCMP582 #2 step driver VCCO\n-5V_SMP     -5.0  30 mA*   43 mA*   F      RP117K501D  fixed       C      ADCMP582 #1 VEE, LT1678 V-\n-5V_ST      -5.0  50 mA    70 mA    F      RP117K501D  fixed       RC x2  ADCMP582 #2 + #3 VEE\n+3V3_LOGIC  +3.3  60 mA*   100 mA*  G      TPS7A87     33k2/10k7   plain  LVC glue, TLV3601 x3, EEPROM\n+5V_DIG     +5.1  600 mA*  1 A*     H      none        -           -      MCU + FPGA boards (switched)\n+5V_OCXO    +5.1  170 mA*  600 mA*  H      none (LC)   -           -      OCXO (always on)\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
